OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged after city centre
OL,4,Adisturbance
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged after both
OL,7,Fsuffering injuries in a disturbance in
OL,8,FNottingham.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to reports of a
OL,11,Fstabbing in Canal Street at 16:53 BST
OL,12,Fon Friday, and a 35-year-old man was
OL,13,Ftaken to hospital with injuries the
OL,14,Fforce said were not believed to be
OL,15,Flife-threatening.
OL,17,FA second man, aged 42, was found in a
OL,18,Fnearby flat with injuries to his arm,
OL,19,Fleg and face, believed to have been
OL,20,Fcaused by a broken bottle, the police
OL,21,Fadded. He was also taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
