OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged after city centre
OL,4,Adisturbance
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, the force said Levi
OL,7,FWildridge, 42, of no fixed address, and
OL,8,FBenjamin Mitchell, 35, of Mansfield
OL,9,FRoad, Nottingham, had been charged with
OL,10,Fwounding with intent and affray.
